    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "<blockquote local-id=\"a3c9ad5352c2\"><p local-id=\"d45d707a02bf\"><strong>How to use this template</strong> Copy this page for every new TSD. Fill in each section in order. Delete the instruction callouts (the grey/amber guidance text) before submitting for review. A TSD is not approved for implementation until Section 8 (Decision Record) is signed off by the Technical Lead.</p><p local-id=\"c6434d335a98\"><strong>One TSD = one problem.</strong> If you find yourself writing \"and also…\" in Section 1, you need a second TSD.</p></blockquote><hr local-id=\"463a149f04fb\"/><h2 local-id=\"90ded6fd5056\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"6884735f2ebf\" ac:macro-id=\"264b2155-0536-4d8c-b27d-370aebcedf6c\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">document-information</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>Document Information</h2><table ac:local-id=\"fe4ce98aedc8\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"b69b656f5d0d\"><th ac:local-id=\"b0d53aa1bf21\"><p local-id=\"99595393a0d3\">Field</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"8a02df029050\"><p local-id=\"e4cac7f9c3e6\">Value</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"e030b641924c\"><td ac:local-id=\"8bc02a4541f7\"><p local-id=\"1b9b45488b74\"><strong>Document ID</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7d6a0bf48253\"><p local-id=\"fabc409daddd\">TSD-[JIRA-KEY]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"daa21e3d092b\"><td ac:local-id=\"70cf5e4a8f4b\"><p local-id=\"2376d6dca187\"><strong>Author(s)</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0d8801aeefd0\"><p local-id=\"1dc4a54ed115\">[Name] — [Squad / Role]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"d3df34a76a07\"><td ac:local-id=\"2a19fafbe8e8\"><p local-id=\"8a98f041a27d\"><strong>Reviewer(s)</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"93ed9050d5fa\"><p local-id=\"92ec13dbf899\">[Lead name] — [Role]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"afb5132c9e90\"><td ac:local-id=\"767ad6e9c012\"><p local-id=\"28ec14f205ed\"><strong>Created</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"854889dd889a\"><p local-id=\"b24dc670f847\">[DD MMM YYYY]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"c156ac1ba8eb\"><td ac:local-id=\"11424bd56993\"><p local-id=\"71516ce31aa9\"><strong>Version</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3914d6ef2a9d\"><p local-id=\"68830364e88f\">v0.1 — Draft</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"6292f20ab587\"><td ac:local-id=\"28e9558489dc\"><p local-id=\"4d3a1b732b1d\"><strong>Status</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"00592393b597\"><p local-id=\"9b811fabc239\">Draft</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"721c8355f031\"><td ac:local-id=\"09b390135dbd\"><p local-id=\"a967c0a04f60\"><strong>Related Jira</strong></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6efe99a6b8ec\"><p local-id=\"ece59e9d3c35\">[JIRA-KEY]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr local-id=\"fccdd41cb3f5\"/><h2 local-id=\"8552facc3c66\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"6c6e0eb1bd06\" ac:macro-id=\"44e8378f-d528-4485-8718-e5f8710a2e12\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">version-history</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>Version History</h2><table ac:local-id=\"edd5574d13d8\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"bc342e084866\"><th ac:local-id=\"470650f5e44f\"><p local-id=\"bc2d990bda7d\">Version</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"985e16850d2d\"><p local-id=\"da09d49c7e8e\">Date</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"eb6b5d8ee9e5\"><p local-id=\"6f40fe721b9f\">Summary of Change</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"553b1486152f\"><p local-id=\"c35972a3dafe\">Author</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"4b5b5c05f04a\"><td ac:local-id=\"bd69c0190f00\"><p local-id=\"024e4c8b6620\">v0.1</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a9bdcd9fd894\"><p local-id=\"b839018ecdb9\">[DD MMM YYYY]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c0ab6d06002c\"><p local-id=\"b007902c997c\">Initial draft</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f45fec0438a7\"><p local-id=\"99f9b6a5af36\">[Name]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr local-id=\"e8fca9fc092a\"/><h2 local-id=\"21ef17121655\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"183a4ab023cf\" ac:macro-id=\"c85be3c5-ff70-43ca-a948-90712e2d8d89\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">1-problem-statement</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>1. Problem Statement</h2><blockquote local-id=\"ec8cc10abca3\"><p local-id=\"1c949879f1b5\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> State the problem in 3–5 sentences. This is <strong>not the solution</strong>. Do not mention technology choices here. A reader who knows nothing about this ticket should understand exactly what is broken or missing after reading this section.</p><p local-id=\"697abb0cdc65\">⚠ <strong>Do NOT include:</strong> options, implementation details, or the recommended approach. Those belong in later sections.</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"9d884eec75bc\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"ecb2ee99a6a6\" ac:macro-id=\"1062ee92-e3bc-4deb-89c4-90c10660a551\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">11-context</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>1.1 Context</h3><p local-id=\"397abac4be40\">[Describe the business or technical context in 2–3 sentences. What feature or flow does this affect?]</p><h3 local-id=\"67234236153e\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"506612fc0a25\" ac:macro-id=\"b673eef3-a3e6-48ac-a7e4-a481a41849d9\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">12-problem</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>1.2 Problem</h3><p local-id=\"a62449015c11\">[What specifically is broken, missing, or needs to change? Be precise. Avoid vague language like \"improve\" or \"enhance\".]</p><h3 local-id=\"33fe9c45feb4\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"98046de2b21b\" ac:macro-id=\"7c8e06b1-5547-4b50-9d09-7fb9859c71b7\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">13-impact-if-not-solved</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>1.3 Impact if Not Solved</h3><p local-id=\"c1b64843f292\">[What happens if we do nothing? This can be a user impact, a technical risk, a delivery risk, or a commercial consequence.]</p><h3 local-id=\"cab902b301cc\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"9eba8d265c58\" ac:macro-id=\"eb20ef6f-fdd9-4cad-9df7-d4088d9d53d7\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">14-success-criteria</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>1.4 Success Criteria</h3><p local-id=\"046bddc8f06b\">[How will we know the problem is solved? State 2–4 measurable or testable outcomes.]</p><p local-id=\"a4fdf961062e\"><em>Example: \"User can add a product to wishlist without being logged in, and the item persists after login.\"</em></p><hr local-id=\"259a4bb6ec63\"/><h2 local-id=\"81e6b4e7631e\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"e16d2b8fc9e2\" ac:macro-id=\"9ca6d5f0-58c8-44dc-9465-28e3e35e2d4a\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">2-constraints--assumptions</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>2. Constraints &amp; Assumptions</h2><blockquote local-id=\"70ccf2ae2b15\"><p local-id=\"5ad4ced339fa\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> Constraints are non-negotiable boundaries. Assumptions are things you are treating as true for the purpose of this document. Both must be listed <strong>before</strong> the options analysis — they are what the options are evaluated against.</p><p local-id=\"55f517ac1148\">⚠ If an assumption turns out to be wrong, the TSD must be updated and re-reviewed. Do not proceed to implementation if a constraint has changed.</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"c417a5c4775b\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"525bbba05a5d\" ac:macro-id=\"bf877220-0036-4345-85bc-26319ebf7daa\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">21-constraints</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>2.1 Constraints</h3><table ac:local-id=\"197aeae891b8\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"ad84974a697e\"><th ac:local-id=\"14e307d77bd4\"><p local-id=\"aaeb971f0c49\">Constraint</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"4144d873c036\"><p local-id=\"8272f382455b\">Detail</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"5a5fae8e0b92\"><td ac:local-id=\"ec148574d5bb\"><p local-id=\"4940f581323a\">Platform</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4dc58c01ef13\"><p local-id=\"b29ef6bd044c\">SFCC B2C Commerce + PWA Kit on MRT. No alternative platform is in scope.</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"f1997ab81cd7\"><td ac:local-id=\"c4a5932c499e\"><p local-id=\"51c6fbaf097c\">Integration layer</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f9a008eec162\"><p local-id=\"13f4920e32e6\">All backend system calls must route through MuleSoft. No new direct point-to-point connections from SFCC.</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"144aa10579ea\"><td ac:local-id=\"065aaba63a84\"><p local-id=\"bf45b488ebce\">Storefront scope</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"72b5a172596e\"><p local-id=\"76ad8f46002d\">Solution must work across all 7 storefronts (AU, UK, US Dom, US Intl, EU, ME). No single-market workarounds.</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"4733d6e05fdf\"><td ac:local-id=\"3d298539e424\"><p local-id=\"ac902b1fea9d\">[Add constraint]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f67ed80b69e6\"><p local-id=\"55d082ad5266\">[Detail]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id=\"dcaaf97ef957\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"135455aa32ca\" ac:macro-id=\"7b040f77-14c1-4fcf-8b88-4fca76fac257\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">22-assumptions</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>2.2 Assumptions</h3><table ac:local-id=\"5288ddea609b\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"ffef3cb6316c\"><th ac:local-id=\"c6ed61ea1e4e\"><p local-id=\"e18a9658cd51\">Assumption</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"f7e11c651ff0\"><p local-id=\"35cd049cf59f\">Risk if Wrong</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"b92d8c2d5f71\"><td ac:local-id=\"fb629971f1f2\"><p local-id=\"8d7863664afc\">[State assumption]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"69d7351bbe34\"><p local-id=\"fd5003139bc4\">[What breaks if this is not true?]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"570d9460ac39\"><td ac:local-id=\"57ee32ae5c66\"><p local-id=\"071ad3098e8a\">[State assumption]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"886240a6c46f\"><p local-id=\"e26c46adb4f1\">[What breaks if this is not true?]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr local-id=\"f4f956218446\"/><h2 local-id=\"639e910835bd\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"999389c2771d\" ac:macro-id=\"01614bc4-eb7e-41aa-b0d4-97928554c01e\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">3-options-analysis</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>3. Options Analysis</h2><blockquote local-id=\"9e9f3e71a57f\"><p local-id=\"8aaffe22f281\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> List every viable approach considered — including \"do nothing\" if relevant. Keep descriptions short (2–4 sentences per option). Pros and cons should be <strong>specific to this problem and these constraints</strong> — not generic.</p><p local-id=\"a4ed74d3b6db\">⚠ <strong>Do NOT include implementation steps in this section.</strong> Save implementation detail for Section 5 (the chosen option only). Options you discarded still need a brief entry so reviewers can see you considered them.</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"9e38d64b0d35\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"6a4d6a1d17fd\" ac:macro-id=\"0622918d-b5da-4a57-9576-84096ef5919e\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">31-options-summary</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>3.1 Options Summary</h3><table ac:local-id=\"0a0a97a14346\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"0034ceee7bb0\"><th ac:local-id=\"a30b0ce1e0f3\"><p local-id=\"9fb91d24e78e\">Option</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"779601af0da5\"><p local-id=\"427565607037\">Pros</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"7575f3182de3\"><p local-id=\"9e37d224cc65\">Cons</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"376ed5b46a3c\"><p local-id=\"79f745f1fa31\">Viable?</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"76f0bc2d62fe\"><td ac:local-id=\"553a35d6ff77\"><p local-id=\"7fb348282294\"><strong>Option A</strong> — [Short name]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8aa0643d86f0\"><p local-id=\"51d8df30cf0e\">+ [Specific advantage] + [Specific advantage]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a39a1ec2cfaa\"><p local-id=\"e061ec2dd9fa\">- [Specific disadvantage] - [Specific disadvantage]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"be1e28aaafbe\"><p local-id=\"680f861c05ed\">Yes</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"e7870898318b\"><td ac:local-id=\"05c0170d3312\"><p local-id=\"1fbc8b0f6147\"><strong>Option B</strong> — [Short name]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0c596248806e\"><p local-id=\"3b5fa6a07c1b\">+ [Specific advantage]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b1189301027d\"><p local-id=\"b78e5ebd9ec1\">- [Specific disadvantage]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e60ddad1e10a\"><p local-id=\"a30e0d7c1a9f\">Yes</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"1e85880dbf4a\"><td ac:local-id=\"e847f89a7086\"><p local-id=\"86ffe2117b59\"><strong>Option C</strong> — [Short name]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"625ecd24e1fe\"><p local-id=\"9901dac0c49f\">+ [Specific advantage]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"48eeb0cd3083\"><p local-id=\"6c2df0e758ee\">- [Disqualifying reason — be specific]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7d836dd9aa81\"><p local-id=\"8bd56adfaf6e\">No</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id=\"37425b261a78\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"c2a131dff850\" ac:macro-id=\"264ec63e-861e-4f2c-85b9-875b63e01089\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">32-option-detail</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>3.2 Option Detail</h3><blockquote local-id=\"5a1f82e3100a\"><p local-id=\"2b33ff7858ed\">ℹ For each viable option, write 2–4 sentences of detail. Do not write implementation steps. Focus on how the option fits (or conflicts with) the constraints in Section 2.</p></blockquote><h4 local-id=\"4fdbf813bc00\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"8f177946fab6\" ac:macro-id=\"b108377b-2660-4ac1-8f30-9651eee23ed9\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">option-a--short-name</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>Option A — [Short name]</h4><p local-id=\"e7f787688521\">[Describe the approach in 2–4 sentences. What pattern or mechanism does it use? Why is it viable against the constraints?]</p><h4 local-id=\"b10f6556272b\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"20adce30586b\" ac:macro-id=\"859f1ef3-68e7-4b84-8897-f26fb4bd776a\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">option-b--short-name</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>Option B — [Short name]</h4><p local-id=\"d40cbb7a52e7\">[Describe the approach in 2–4 sentences.]</p><h4 local-id=\"a0584f4de8e3\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"d9a138e665c8\" ac:macro-id=\"8ca8fd06-d8dd-47f3-bdf7-a6f72f2d9546\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">option-c--short-name-discarded</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>Option C — [Short name] <em>(Discarded)</em></h4><p local-id=\"56fe08a249ea\">[One sentence on why this was discarded. Example: \"Discarded — requires a direct SFCC-to-AP21 connection, which violates the MuleSoft constraint.\"]</p><hr local-id=\"83bd1957b90a\"/><h2 local-id=\"4b11f1b03997\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"a8ba37d943b0\" ac:macro-id=\"8e56d8a3-306d-4a4d-864e-fdbc21798e23\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">4-recommended-option--rationale</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>4. Recommended Option &amp; Rationale</h2><blockquote local-id=\"03905cbc3b39\"><p local-id=\"650b9c4a053b\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> State which option you are recommending and why. This should be 1–2 short paragraphs. Reference the constraints and success criteria from Sections 1 and 2. Do <strong>not</strong> repeat the full option description — just the reason for the choice.</p><p local-id=\"625a1cfd7cf2\">⚠ If there is genuine disagreement between the author and reviewer about which option to choose, do not resolve it here. Escalate to the Lead and document the outcome in the Decision Record (Section 8).</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"56afd59b14b8\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"7ef2fd0a98ae\" ac:macro-id=\"395698f7-2ab3-4bfb-8646-157ab1d3b241\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">41-recommended-option</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>4.1 Recommended Option</h3><p local-id=\"0dadb9b55f9a\"><strong>[Option X — Short name]</strong></p><h3 local-id=\"c8af592d07cf\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"8cf93d79c67f\" ac:macro-id=\"7a9a5e8c-ba2f-4fa1-ab7f-c18d2bcf5f2e\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">42-rationale</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>4.2 Rationale</h3><p local-id=\"536c819f094c\">[Why this option over the others? Be specific. Example: \"Option A is recommended over Option B because it reuses the existing MuleSoft order event pattern, which keeps the integration boundary consistent and avoids introducing a new direct SFCC webhook.\"]</p><h3 local-id=\"0c032d63950d\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"96a4302a55e0\" ac:macro-id=\"b922b216-06e6-4737-a442-bffa5e547cc0\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">43-tradeoffs-accepted</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>4.3 Trade-offs Accepted</h3><p local-id=\"ee09e063bb61\">[What are you knowingly accepting by choosing this option? Every option has a trade-off. If you cannot identify one, look harder.]</p><p local-id=\"a88b4b588328\"><em>Example: \"This approach requires an additional MuleSoft API to be built by the integration team. This adds a dependency on the MuleSoft sprint cycle.\"</em></p><hr local-id=\"60ca4f1d4876\"/><h2 local-id=\"e9525e9fc1d2\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"d40bdd723518\" ac:macro-id=\"0a3dba53-549a-4354-aa98-1146c21d78fd\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">5-technical-implementation</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5. Technical Implementation</h2><blockquote local-id=\"b278f227f878\"><p local-id=\"3b281a621a8e\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> This section covers the <strong>chosen option only</strong>. It must be specific enough for a developer who was not in any meeting to build from. Include: sequence, data structures, API contracts, error handling, and any configuration.</p><p local-id=\"f66dc63e0612\">⚠ <strong>Do NOT</strong> copy-paste option descriptions from Section 3 into this section. This section is forward-looking implementation detail, not a re-statement of the approach.</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"f5b33d327272\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"397dd65e039c\" ac:macro-id=\"a758b248-8469-4885-9159-cdc8de81a536\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">51-highlevel-sequence</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5.1 High-Level Sequence</h3><blockquote local-id=\"7237873b4ff1\"><p local-id=\"5d687b97b1e2\">ℹ Describe the end-to-end flow in numbered steps. Keep each step to one sentence. If the sequence has branches (e.g. error path vs happy path), show both.</p></blockquote><ol local-id=\"d7c64b439c4a\" start=\"1\"><li local-id=\"7e56c5670477\"><p local-id=\"c9f90937d0ba\">[Step one — what happens, who/what triggers it]</p></li><li local-id=\"a9f36e0c6753\"><p local-id=\"40c7cf7de4dc\">[Step two]</p></li><li local-id=\"c18f070b6f12\"><p local-id=\"8a2660fadb81\">[Step three — include error path if relevant: \"If X fails, Y occurs\"]</p></li><li local-id=\"6404c39ad2b0\"><p local-id=\"e4ef369dc3da\">[Continue until the flow is complete]</p></li></ol><h3 local-id=\"8a1bba9d7bd9\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"26c6c7a17fb2\" ac:macro-id=\"09fc9ccf-5c26-4f9e-942f-2e23cfab0d0a\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">52-component--api-changes</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5.2 Component / API Changes</h3><table ac:local-id=\"79363479b2a9\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"a3ece89d7a7e\"><th ac:local-id=\"7767020b4830\"><p local-id=\"766c0bc268db\">File / Endpoint</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"9e3d52dc5303\"><p local-id=\"91e8f462220d\">Change Required</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"536a7b292165\"><p local-id=\"f06a6385257a\">Type</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"8887c74488fb\"><td ac:local-id=\"e29d09dc4c88\"><p local-id=\"ef7e32b2e3b8\">[Path or endpoint]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5855ca63be68\"><p local-id=\"01a374d3c352\">[What changes and why]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e68fd4895b2e\"><p local-id=\"97d19be08c17\">New / Modified / Deleted</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"f8d421087caf\"><td ac:local-id=\"e64b2e99660d\"><p local-id=\"d252de122a60\">[Path or endpoint]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"00ad29e26dd7\"><p local-id=\"fabcb01bd9eb\">[What changes and why]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4ab503fb8d46\"><p local-id=\"14cf65532be6\">New / Modified / Deleted</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id=\"c1a5c839af00\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"f9eb90e3d6c0\" ac:macro-id=\"f847b1e3-f6e9-4f1f-9669-6d251a6bfa05\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">53-data-structures--interfaces</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5.3 Data Structures / Interfaces</h3><blockquote local-id=\"c1852eb0adf0\"><p local-id=\"02561ba86f48\">ℹ If this involves a new or changed API contract, request/response shape, or data model — show it here. Use JSON or pseudocode. Do not describe it in prose if a structure diagram is clearer.</p></blockquote><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"a5345844d057\" ac:macro-id=\"eaecf0f3-0c06-4a80-a607-4d5bf574c6ad\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">json</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"breakoutMode\">wide</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"breakoutWidth\">1800</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[// Example: new MuleSoft event payload\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"uuid-v4\",\n  \"eventType\": \"[event-name]\",\n  \"payload\": { }\n}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3 local-id=\"0289e1bc5018\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"1ff4afec8eb1\" ac:macro-id=\"c67adf78-7d91-4053-adb1-b835575a591e\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">54-error-handling--edge-cases</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5.4 Error Handling &amp; Edge Cases</h3><table ac:local-id=\"fd9ecd3105e7\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"ecdc32f4b696\"><th ac:local-id=\"344cc0403d7a\"><p local-id=\"a4a0c989a6dd\">Scenario</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"5a6cd4e8f861\"><p local-id=\"b7b40636db91\">Expected Behaviour</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"c54a04bce1d0\"><p local-id=\"2dd80f70687d\">Type</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"9a364b5a39ca\"><td ac:local-id=\"7c20a4737fe7\"><p local-id=\"43a57eca5208\">[Error or edge case]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"091322865c26\"><p local-id=\"30a789d46fbc\">[What should happen — not what currently happens]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b8f105666034\"><p local-id=\"b0def896cf4e\">Error / Edge case</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"83f5b848a5e1\"><td ac:local-id=\"011aa994e381\"><p local-id=\"4bbbc992eccc\">[Error or edge case]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c56e48c5b886\"><p local-id=\"4d853e964241\">[Expected behaviour]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"2325c0c1265a\"><p local-id=\"f1bf9e69fa94\">Error / Edge case</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id=\"4dfe5c498cf9\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"87542d373023\" ac:macro-id=\"8712ded8-a9c5-4fb6-a2de-7ad79d101afd\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">55-configuration--environment-notes</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>5.5 Configuration &amp; Environment Notes</h3><p local-id=\"02bc13727040\">[Any environment-specific configuration, feature flags, Business Manager settings, or MRT environment variables required. If none, write \"None.\"]</p><hr local-id=\"5ce7a5ac67cd\"/><h2 local-id=\"b502f4a77dfd\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"57e7c1366323\" ac:macro-id=\"b232ac9a-9d98-4846-add8-548ebb4c2318\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">6-testing--validation</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>6. Testing &amp; Validation</h2><blockquote local-id=\"f749a252e706\"><p local-id=\"278cb5795305\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> Describe how you will confirm the solution works. This should map directly to the success criteria in Section 1.4. Include at minimum: unit test coverage, one P0 Playwright scenario (if user-facing), and any integration test requirements.</p></blockquote><h3 local-id=\"79d646f86c80\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"9d91eaf33272\" ac:macro-id=\"d44e1bf2-6ef4-428b-ab4d-0778169c795c\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">61-test-coverage</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>6.1 Test Coverage</h3><table ac:local-id=\"f8e70c685cb6\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"ea635597b486\"><th ac:local-id=\"356f2779a9f8\"><p local-id=\"960241583e4e\">Test Type</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"fb91c06cf04c\"><p local-id=\"5e6e35d8df18\">What is Being Tested</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"16fe61902eec\"><p local-id=\"05222c76a199\">Pass Criteria</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"9c6ddf2cd840\"><td ac:local-id=\"871ba876e974\"><p local-id=\"71aa6b7dfb8c\">Unit</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"39a7d2d2e928\"><p local-id=\"8ad3c440868d\">[Component or hook under test]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"31d0412e6539\"><p local-id=\"f9b548204033\">[Expected output or assertion]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"d811f873f832\"><td ac:local-id=\"481d4a731b3a\"><p local-id=\"f92ff579aae5\">Integration</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4bcc3986765c\"><p local-id=\"5b424ae6ef11\">[Integration point under test]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a52949ae8241\"><p local-id=\"f6201c3d54c9\">[Expected response or state]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"e66f31aa36bd\"><td ac:local-id=\"84725a037c5e\"><p local-id=\"b69314c77644\">E2E / Playwright</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"84029afd1c8d\"><p local-id=\"a59f2c8f58b0\">[User journey — tag @p0 if critical path]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f0644a79b4c9\"><p local-id=\"f78e2ad66f6b\">[Observable outcome in the UI]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 local-id=\"b31a61eef01a\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"e493bef044e3\" ac:macro-id=\"f4c3a009-4335-4b7b-9a27-56eb5c33bef2\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">62-regression-risk</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>6.2 Regression Risk</h3><p local-id=\"a2d040f105d8\">[What existing functionality could this change break? Where will you check? If regression risk is low, state why — do not just write \"low\".]</p><hr local-id=\"412e3cb14942\"/><h2 local-id=\"2af74f635b44\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"ba0402a555e6\" ac:macro-id=\"e9b86a01-1335-4fe4-a4d1-8478a7e8cbd3\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">7-risks--mitigations</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>7. Risks &amp; Mitigations</h2><blockquote local-id=\"4948d6bfdcff\"><p local-id=\"49181e6cf5d6\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> List implementation risks — not the business problem from Section 1. These are things that could cause the implementation to fail or be delayed.</p><p local-id=\"63f13f5aa65e\">⚠ <strong>\"No risks identified\" is almost never correct.</strong> Every implementation has at least one dependency, one unknown, or one constraint that could cause a problem. Think harder.</p></blockquote><table ac:local-id=\"b34be252e2b5\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"8b9fdf3bd711\"><th ac:local-id=\"35e41a6ef215\"><p local-id=\"ad18a9d19fec\">Risk</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"056c74a6b392\"><p local-id=\"0f07b4386e0c\">Likelihood</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"9d5abb6c6cd6\"><p local-id=\"1b916f246650\">Mitigation</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"a2535f31e06b\"><p local-id=\"781ccf5472c6\">Owner</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"c66ae5dd53cc\"><td ac:local-id=\"158f21ede915\"><p local-id=\"6c5a5722af40\">[Risk description]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d538843f6151\"><p local-id=\"6b09762bafbf\">High / Med / Low</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6f0211875eec\"><p local-id=\"ddacf261eb11\">[What will you do to reduce probability or impact?]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1ea11b66b525\"><p local-id=\"6de9eea98f20\">[Name or role]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"4fdf5a74bf32\"><td ac:local-id=\"3e8770eff316\"><p local-id=\"d8b49f725999\">[Risk description]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"516d2547079b\"><p local-id=\"8802fd6341ce\">High / Med / Low</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4e9a8ac84540\"><p local-id=\"cc1bee344091\">[Mitigation]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ffa58f63ff31\"><p local-id=\"49a8d101df38\">[Name or role]</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"43e4f7e0f9d9\"><td ac:local-id=\"bbd08560b60d\"><p local-id=\"be4f87c23f25\">Dependency on [team/system] not delivered in time</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6b6fa97815f0\"><p local-id=\"d75c6b02caf0\">Med</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"0c0aef267479\"><p local-id=\"26c5c7f31719\">[Agreed fallback or sequencing change]</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"09d556c32a3e\"><p local-id=\"785850249164\">[Lead name]</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr local-id=\"12c04e35c83d\"/><h2 local-id=\"a08d66e6875e\"><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"94b3d24da62b\" ac:macro-id=\"4640728b-05f5-4ded-a3e6-9f21bc60515f\" ac:name=\"anchor\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\">8-decision-record</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro>8. Decision Record</h2><blockquote local-id=\"145e56915139\"><p local-id=\"5b5ad3b0aa38\">ℹ <strong>Guidance:</strong> Record every significant decision made about this solution — including decisions made in meetings or Slack that are not obvious from the document itself. This section is what prevents decisions from being relitigated. It is also the sign-off record.</p></blockquote><table ac:local-id=\"b30fd8fe8c2c\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"d0c944a1c209\"><th ac:local-id=\"12f175072374\"><p local-id=\"4e04b5ff1211\">Date</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"84af283e4bc8\"><p local-id=\"6adf426df722\">Decision Maker</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"fd0014bf40bd\"><p local-id=\"eafb5aeeb451\">Decision</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"72afc53469a7\"><p local-id=\"fcc67cb42736\">Outcome / Rationale</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"f646fd2fa8c8\"><td ac:local-id=\"69caba5e9b7f\"><p loca